      id="F_7ea0eb5c-5a8f-49ec-a09f-176974e84086">&lt;p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt;The components of lease expense were as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
       &lt;table style="margin-left:auto;border-spacing:0;table-layout:auto;width:100.0%;border-collapse:separate;margin-right:auto;"&gt;
        &lt;tr style="visibility:collapse;"&gt;
