    <us-gaap:CompensationRelatedCostsPolicyTextBlock
      contextRef="C_24317829-d237-4c29-bae3-2e46dd1ae625"
      id="F_44a51b02-c326-4b0f-a9ed-d90b74a9bcf7">&lt;p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt;We estimated the fair values of our restricted stock-based awards that are solely subject to service-based vesting requirements based upon their market values as of the grant dates, discounted for the present values of expected dividends.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</us-gaap:CompensationRelatedCostsPolicyTextBlock>
    <us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedPaymentAwardStockOptionsValuationAssumptionsTableTextBlock
      contextRef="C_24317829-d237-4c29-bae3-2e46dd1ae625"
      id="F_fe2eb6fc-7933-43ab-87ed-8edb259bd2d3">&lt;span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt;The weighted-average input assumptions used and resulting fair values of our&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt; SOs and PSOs were as follows for fiscal 2026:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt;&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
       &lt;table style="margin-left:auto;border-spacing:0;table-layout:auto;width:100.0%;border-collapse:separate;margin-right:auto;"&gt;
        &lt;tr style="visibility:collapse;"&gt;
