        <link:footnote id="FNT_e6cb086c-500a-409f-8222-41f68a1c0504" xlink:label="FNT_e6cb086c-500a-409f-8222-41f68a1c0504" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US"><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">In fiscal 2026, we issued $</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">43.0</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> billion of senior notes for general corporate purposes, which may include capital expenditures, repayment of indebtedness, future investments or acquisitions and payment of cash dividends on or repurchases of our common stock.</xhtml:span></link:footnote>
