        <link:footnote id="FNT_69975356-46e3-4a4a-9792-0b1bf5b40a50" xlink:label="FNT_69975356-46e3-4a4a-9792-0b1bf5b40a50" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US"><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">As of </xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">May 31, 2026</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, $</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">581</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million and $</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">72</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million were recorded in other current liabilities and other non-current liabilities, respectively, within our consolidated balance sheets. As of </xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">May 31, 2025</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, substantially all restructuring liabilities have been recorded in other current liabilities within our consolidated balance sheets.</xhtml:span></link:footnote>
