        <link:footnote id="FNT_ec9c574f-81b1-4ce5-86a8-04a6bc16eb1b" xlink:label="FNT_ec9c574f-81b1-4ce5-86a8-04a6bc16eb1b" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US"><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The unrecognized compensation expense calculated under the fair value method for shares expected to vest as of </xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">May 31, 2026</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> was $</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">1.8</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> billion and is expected to be recognized over a weighted-average period of </xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;"><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">3.30</xhtml:span></xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> years. Approximately </xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">1</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million shares outstanding as of </xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">May 31, 2026</xhtml:span><xhtml:span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:7.5pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> were not expected to vest.</xhtml:span></link:footnote>
